{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "cam_templates",
  "description": "Expression-template library for the CAM6 physics (stage 2 of the EqESM project): the pointwise saturation-thermodynamics laws of the wv_saturation/wv_sat_methods modules (components/cam/src/atmos_phys/to_be_ccppized/wv_saturation.F90 and wv_sat_methods.F90 of the instrumented cam6_4_212 fork), transcribed exactly for use by the stage-2 CAM components (cam_wv_saturation.esm, cam_rayleigh_friction.esm, cam_energy_fixer.esm). The library carries (a) the Goff-Gratch saturation vapor pressures goff_gratch_water and goff_gratch_ice (wv_sat_methods.F90:569-580 and 611-620, the esatw/esati branch of svp_water/svp_ice); (b) the mixed-phase weight ice_weight (wv_sat_methods.F90:494-498 and wv_saturation.F90:555-562) and the blended svp_trans (wv_sat_methods.F90:479-513) that generates the tabulated estbl of wv_saturation.F90:191-254 (the estbl table itself lives in cam_wv_saturation.esm as a function_tables entry, generated from svp_trans at T = 127.16..377.16 K); (c) the saturation specific humidity svp_to_qsat = epsilo es / (p - omeps es), unity when saturated (wv_sat_methods.F90:185-197); and (d) the latent-heat laws of calc_hltalt (wv_saturation.F90:521-573): hltalt_no_ip (no-ice-phase branch), hltalt_mixed (the full law, adding the ice-phase weight times LATICE) and tterm_transition (the pcf(5) polynomial of the water-minus-ice es correction, factored into the shared pcf_transition_poly(tc) template, Horner-evaluated in the Fortran order and divided by ttrice). Constants are SHR_CONST_* values (shr_const_mod.F90:24-55): LATVAP = 2.501e6 J/kg, LATICE = 3.337e5 J/kg, TKFRZ = 273.15 K, and the wv_saturation locals TBOIL = 373.16 K, TKTRIP = 273.16 K, TTRICE = 20 K, PCF = [5.04469588506e-01, -5.47288442819e+00, -3.67471858735e-01, -8.95963532403e-03, -7.78053686625e-05]. The repeated temperature constants are named as zero-parameter constant-fragment templates applied with empty bindings: tmelt = TKFRZ = 273.15 K, tboil = TBOIL = 373.16 K, ttrice = TTRICE = 20 K (TKTRIP = 273.16 K stays inline in goff_gratch_ice). The Goff-Gratch curve-fit coefficients are dimensionless (the fit as written is dimensionally incoherent: a log10 of an hPa-valued number, exponentiated and scaled by 100); the x100 hPa-to-Pa factor carries the Pa dimension so the analytic laws read as Pa. All laws are pointwise; tests of the analytic branch structure live in the SvpTransLaw model of cam_wv_saturation.esm, pinned to the stage-1 qsat dumps (stage1/dumps/cam/cam_qsat.csv) through the estbl table they generate."
 },
 "expression_templates": {
  "ice_weight": {
   "description": "Mixed-phase weight of calc_hltalt (wv_saturation.F90:555-562) and svp_trans (wv_sat_methods.F90:494-498): weight = min(1, max(0, (tmelt - t)/ttrice)), the clamp form of the Fortran's three-branch if (weight = 1 below tmelt - ttrice, 0 at and above tmelt, linear between). The clamp is bit-identical to the branches: (tmelt - t)/ttrice equals 1 exactly at t = tmelt - ttrice and 0 at t = tmelt, is positive below tmelt and negative above, so the outer min/max select the constant branches exactly where the Fortran does. tmelt and ttrice are the tmelt/ttrice constant-fragment templates (TKFRZ = 273.15 K, TTRICE = 20 K).",
   "params": [
    "t"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "min",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "const",
      "args": [],
      "value": 1.0,
      "units": "1"
     },
     {
      "op": "max",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "const",
        "args": [],
        "value": 0.0,
        "units": "1"
       },
       {
        "op": "/",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "-",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "tmelt",
            "bindings": {}
           },
           "t"
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "apply_expression_template",
          "args": [],
          "name": "ttrice",
          "bindings": {}
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "goff_gratch_water": {
   "description": "Saturation vapor pressure over water, esatw branch of svp_water (wv_sat_methods.F90:569-580): es = 10^(-7.90298 (tboil/t - 1) + 5.02808 log10(tboil/t) - 1.3816e-7 (10^(11.344 (1 - t/tboil)) - 1) + 8.1328e-3 (10^(-3.49149 (tboil/t - 1)) - 1) + log10(1013.246)) x 100, tboil = 373.16 K. The curve-fit coefficients are dimensionless (dimensionally incoherent fit, see the file description); the x100 hPa-to-Pa factor carries the Pa dimension, so the template reads as es in Pa.",
   "params": [
    "t"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "*",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "const",
      "args": [],
      "value": 100.0,
      "units": "Pa"
     },
     {
      "op": "^",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "const",
        "args": [],
        "value": 10.0,
        "units": "1"
       },
       {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "+",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "const",
              "args": [],
              "value": -7.90298,
              "units": "1"
             },
             {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
               {
                "op": "/",
                "args": [
                 {
                  "op": "apply_expression_template",
                  "args": [],
                  "name": "tboil",
                  "bindings": {}
                 },
                 "t"
                ]
               },
               {
                "op": "const",
                "args": [],
                "value": 1.0,
                "units": "1"
               }
              ]
             }
            ]
           },
           {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "const",
              "args": [],
              "value": 5.02808,
              "units": "1"
             },
             {
              "op": "log10",
              "args": [
               {
                "op": "/",
                "args": [
                 {
                  "op": "apply_expression_template",
                  "args": [],
                  "name": "tboil",
                  "bindings": {}
                 },
                 "t"
                ]
               }
              ]
             }
            ]
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "+",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "const",
              "args": [],
              "value": -1.3816e-07,
              "units": "1"
             },
             {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
               {
                "op": "^",
                "args": [
                 {
                  "op": "const",
                  "args": [],
                  "value": 10.0,
                  "units": "1"
                 },
                 {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                   {
                    "op": "const",
                    "args": [],
                    "value": 11.344,
                    "units": "1"
                   },
                   {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                     {
                      "op": "const",
                      "args": [],
                      "value": 1.0,
                      "units": "1"
                     },
                     {
                      "op": "/",
                      "args": [
                       "t",
                       {
                        "op": "apply_expression_template",
                        "args": [],
                        "name": "tboil",
                        "bindings": {}
                       }
                      ]
                     }
                    ]
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ]
               },
               {
                "op": "const",
                "args": [],
                "value": 1.0,
                "units": "1"
               }
              ]
             }
            ]
           },
           {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
               {
                "op": "const",
                "args": [],
                "value": 8.1328e-03,
                "units": "1"
               },
               {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                 {
                  "op": "^",
                  "args": [
                   {
                    "op": "const",
                    "args": [],
                    "value": 10.0,
                    "units": "1"
                   },
                   {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                     {
                      "op": "const",
                      "args": [],
                      "value": -3.49149,
                      "units": "1"
                     },
                     {
                      "op": "-",
                      "args": [
                       {
                        "op": "/",
                        "args": [
                         {
                          "op": "apply_expression_template",
                          "args": [],
                          "name": "tboil",
                          "bindings": {}
                         },
                         "t"
                        ]
                       },
                       {
                        "op": "const",
                        "args": [],
                        "value": 1.0,
                        "units": "1"
                       }
                      ]
                     }
                    ]
                   }
                  ]
                 },
                 {
                  "op": "const",
                  "args": [],
                  "value": 1.0,
                  "units": "1"
                 }
                ]
               }
              ]
             },
             {
              "op": "log10",
              "args": [
               {
                "op": "const",
                "args": [],
                "value": 1013.246,
                "units": "1"
               }
              ]
             }
            ]
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "goff_gratch_ice": {
   "description": "Saturation vapor pressure over ice, esati branch of svp_ice (wv_sat_methods.F90:611-620): es = 10^(-9.09718 (h2otrip/t - 1) - 3.56654 log10(h2otrip/t) + 0.876793 (1 - t/h2otrip) + log10(6.1071)) x 100, h2otrip = 273.16 K (TKTRIP). Coefficients dimensionless as in goff_gratch_water; the x100 factor carries the Pa dimension.",
   "params": [
    "t"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "*",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "const",
      "args": [],
      "value": 100.0,
      "units": "Pa"
     },
     {
      "op": "^",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "const",
        "args": [],
        "value": 10.0,
        "units": "1"
       },
       {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "+",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "const",
              "args": [],
              "value": -9.09718,
              "units": "1"
             },
             {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
               {
                "op": "/",
                "args": [
                 {
                  "op": "const",
                  "args": [],
                  "value": 273.16,
                  "units": "K"
                 },
                 "t"
                ]
               },
               {
                "op": "const",
                "args": [],
                "value": 1.0,
                "units": "1"
               }
              ]
             }
            ]
           },
           {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "const",
              "args": [],
              "value": -3.56654,
              "units": "1"
             },
             {
              "op": "log10",
              "args": [
               {
                "op": "/",
                "args": [
                 {
                  "op": "const",
                  "args": [],
                  "value": 273.16,
                  "units": "K"
                 },
                 "t"
                ]
               }
              ]
             }
            ]
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "+",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "const",
              "args": [],
              "value": 0.876793,
              "units": "1"
             },
             {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
               {
                "op": "const",
                "args": [],
                "value": 1.0,
                "units": "1"
               },
               {
                "op": "/",
                "args": [
                 "t",
                 {
                  "op": "const",
                  "args": [],
                  "value": 273.16,
                  "units": "K"
                 }
                ]
               }
              ]
             }
            ]
           },
           {
            "op": "log10",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "const",
              "args": [],
              "value": 6.1071,
              "units": "1"
             }
            ]
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "svp_trans": {
   "description": "Mixed-phase saturation vapor pressure of svp_trans (wv_sat_methods.F90:479-513), the estbl table-generation law of wv_sat_init (wv_saturation.F90:244-246): es = weight es_ice + (1 - weight) es_water0, where es_water0 is goff_gratch_water when t >= tmelt - ttrice and 0 below, and weight = ice_weight(t). At t < tmelt - ttrice the weight is 1 and the blend collapses to es_ice; at t >= tmelt it is 0 and the blend is es_water; in the 20 K transition band it interpolates linearly. tmelt = 273.15 K, ttrice = 20 K.",
   "params": [
    "t"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "+",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "*",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "apply_expression_template",
        "args": [],
        "name": "ice_weight",
        "bindings": {
         "t": "t"
        }
       },
       {
        "op": "apply_expression_template",
        "args": [],
        "name": "goff_gratch_ice",
        "bindings": {
         "t": "t"
        }
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "op": "*",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "-",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "const",
          "args": [],
          "value": 1.0,
          "units": "1"
         },
         {
          "op": "apply_expression_template",
          "args": [],
          "name": "ice_weight",
          "bindings": {
           "t": "t"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": ">=",
          "args": [
           "t",
           {
            "op": "-",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "apply_expression_template",
              "args": [],
              "name": "tmelt",
              "bindings": {}
             },
             {
              "op": "apply_expression_template",
              "args": [],
              "name": "ttrice",
              "bindings": {}
             }
            ]
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "apply_expression_template",
          "args": [],
          "name": "goff_gratch_water",
          "bindings": {
           "t": "t"
          }
         },
         {
          "op": "const",
          "args": [],
          "value": 0.0,
          "units": "Pa"
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "svp_to_qsat": {
   "description": "Saturation specific humidity of svp_to_qsat (wv_sat_methods.F90:185-197): qs = epsilo es / (p - omeps es), or exactly 1 when p - es <= 0 (saturated). epsilo = MWWV/MWDAIR = 18.016/28.966 = 0.6219705862045155, omeps = 1 - epsilo = 0.3780294137954845 (shr_const_mod.F90:52-54).",
   "params": [
    "es",
    "p"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "ifelse",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "<=",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "-",
        "args": [
         "p",
         "es"
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "const",
        "args": [],
        "value": 0.0,
        "units": "Pa"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "op": "const",
      "args": [],
      "value": 1.0,
      "units": "kg/kg"
     },
     {
      "op": "/",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "const",
          "args": [],
          "value": 0.6219705862045155,
          "units": "1"
         },
         "es"
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "-",
        "args": [
         "p",
         {
          "op": "*",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "const",
            "args": [],
            "value": 0.3780294137954845,
            "units": "1"
           },
           "es"
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "hltalt_no_ip": {
   "description": "Latent heat of vaporization without the ice-phase term, no_ip_hltalt branch of calc_hltalt (wv_saturation.F90:534-547): hltalt = latvap - 2369 (t - tmelt) when t >= tmelt, else latvap. latvap = 2.501e6 J/kg (LATVAP), the 2369 is the J/kg/K temperature adjustment (vap - h2otrip correction of shr_const_mod), tmelt = 273.15 K.",
   "params": [
    "t"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "ifelse",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": ">=",
      "args": [
       "t",
       {
        "op": "apply_expression_template",
        "args": [],
        "name": "tmelt",
        "bindings": {}
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "op": "-",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "const",
        "args": [],
        "value": 2.501e06,
        "units": "J/kg"
       },
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "const",
          "args": [],
          "value": 2369.0,
          "units": "J/(kg*K)"
         },
         {
          "op": "-",
          "args": [
           "t",
           {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "tmelt",
            "bindings": {}
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "op": "const",
      "args": [],
      "value": 2.501e06,
      "units": "J/kg"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "hltalt_mixed": {
   "description": "Latent heat of vaporization of calc_hltalt (wv_saturation.F90:521-573) as evaluated by qsat_line with ip = 0 (the run's no_ip_hltalt path is overridden by the t < tmelt ice term): hltalt = hltalt_no_ip(t) + ice_weight(t) latice, latice = 3.337e5 J/kg (LATICE). The ice weight is 0 at and above tmelt and ramps to 1 at tmelt - ttrice and below, so the correction adds the ice-phase latent heat through the 20 K mixed-phase band.",
   "params": [
    "t"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "+",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "apply_expression_template",
      "args": [],
      "name": "hltalt_no_ip",
      "bindings": {
       "t": "t"
      }
     },
     {
      "op": "*",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "apply_expression_template",
        "args": [],
        "name": "ice_weight",
        "bindings": {
         "t": "t"
        }
       },
       {
        "op": "const",
        "args": [],
        "value": 3.337e05,
        "units": "J/kg"
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "pcf_transition_poly": {
   "description": "The pcf(5) polynomial of the water-minus-ice es correction of calc_hltalt (wv_saturation.F90:548-573): pcf(1) + tc (pcf(2) + tc (pcf(3) + tc (pcf(4) + tc pcf(5)))), Horner-evaluated in the Fortran loop order with tc = t - tmelt (wv_saturation.F90:561-565). Approximates es(water) - es(ice) in Pa over the transition band; the coefficients carry dimensions Pa, Pa/K, Pa/K^2, Pa/K^3, Pa/K^4 so the polynomial reads as Pa. Shared by tterm_transition, which divides it by ttrice.",
   "params": [
    "tc"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "+",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "const",
      "args": [],
      "value": 5.04469588506e-01,
      "units": "Pa"
     },
     {
      "op": "*",
      "args": [
       "tc",
       {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "const",
          "args": [],
          "value": -5.47288442819e+00,
          "units": "Pa/K"
         },
         {
          "op": "*",
          "args": [
           "tc",
           {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "const",
              "args": [],
              "value": -3.67471858735e-01,
              "units": "Pa/K^2"
             },
             {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
               "tc",
               {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                 {
                  "op": "const",
                  "args": [],
                  "value": -8.95963532403e-03,
                  "units": "Pa/K^3"
                 },
                 {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                   "tc",
                   {
                    "op": "const",
                    "args": [],
                    "value": -7.78053686625e-05,
                    "units": "Pa/K^4"
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ]
               }
              ]
             }
            ]
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "tterm_transition": {
   "description": "Transition-band d(es)/dT correction of calc_hltalt (wv_saturation.F90:548-573): tterm = pcf_transition_poly(t - tmelt)/ttrice when tmelt - ttrice <= t < tmelt, else 0. The pcf(5) polynomial (pcf(1) + tc (pcf(2) + tc (pcf(3) + tc (pcf(4) + tc pcf(5)))), Horner order as the Fortran loop, tc = t - tmelt) approximates es(water) - es(ice) in Pa over the transition band and is factored into the shared pcf_transition_poly template; pcf = [5.04469588506e-01, -5.47288442819e+00, -3.67471858735e-01, -8.95963532403e-03, -7.78053686625e-05] with dimensions Pa, Pa/K, Pa/K^2, Pa/K^3, Pa/K^4, so tterm reads as Pa/K. tmelt and ttrice are the tmelt/ttrice constant-fragment templates.",
   "params": [
    "t"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "ifelse",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "<",
      "args": [
       "t",
       {
        "op": "apply_expression_template",
        "args": [],
        "name": "tmelt",
        "bindings": {}
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "op": "ifelse",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": ">=",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "-",
          "args": [
           "t",
           {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "tmelt",
            "bindings": {}
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "-",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "ttrice",
            "bindings": {}
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "/",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "apply_expression_template",
          "args": [],
          "name": "pcf_transition_poly",
          "bindings": {
           "tc": {
            "op": "-",
            "args": [
             "t",
             {
